data: {"id": "3043063124ff468d-thinking-parallel_evidence-1515", "run_id": "3043063124ff468d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 实体确认\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-7ds5p`\n- **UID**: `c3aad7fc-50e4-45ac-b41a-96302d793e28`\n- **Pod IP**: `172.16.104.61`，节点 `node2`\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n- **控制器**: Deployment `workload` → ReplicaSet `workload-6584f97c76` → Pod\n\n### 支持候选原因的证据（CreateContainerConfigError — Secret 配置错误）\n1. **kubectl_describe 事件**（关键）：kubelet 持续报错 `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`（58m 内重复 ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788777206058, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

